\f0\b\fs24 \cf0 Safest Pipeline
\f1\b0 \
For your archive, I\'92d implement this phased stack:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls3\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Intake
\f1\b0 \uc0\u8232 Generate SHA-256, file metadata, PDF/A status, page count, page labels, embedded text density, image coverage.\
\ls3\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Classification
\f1\b0 \uc0\u8232 Mark pages as 
\f2\fs26 born_digital
\f1\fs24 , 
\f2\fs26 scanned
\f1\fs24 , 
\f2\fs26 mixed
\f1\fs24 , 
\f2\fs26 ocr_layer_present
\f1\fs24 , or 
\f2\fs26 problematic
\f1\fs24 .\
\ls3\ilvl0
